 "stimulus_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"3\">\n  <li>A person owes $1,000 on a credit card that charges an interest rate of 2% per month.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Complete this table showing the credit card balance each month if they do not make any payments. Enter each answer to the hundredths place.</p>\n<table class=\"os-raise-midsizetable\">\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Month</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Total Bill In Dollars</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>1</td>\n      <td>1,000</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>2</td>\n      <td>1,020</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>3</td>\n      <td>1,040.40</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>4</td>\n      <td>a.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>5</td>\n      <td>b.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>6</td>\n      <td>c.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>7</td>\n      <td>d.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>8</td>\n      <td>e.</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>",
